{"seq":2,"slug":"integration-ci","title":"CI 集成与持续模糊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/integration-ci","wordCount":1384,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-集成与持续模糊\">CI 集成与持续模糊</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>属性测试和模糊测试的 CI 集成需要双层策略：快速层（PR 检查，限制 max_examples）保证基本覆盖；深度层（定时任务）实现充分探索。模糊测试额外需要语料库持久化、持续模糊基础设施（OSS-Fuzz）和崩溃管理流程。变异测试作为 CI 门禁时应采用增量模式只检查变更代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-ci-集成\">为什么需要 CI 集成</h2><p>属性测试和模糊测试的价值随着运行频率的增加而增长——每次代码变更都可能引入新的边界 bug，只有持续运行才能在缺陷进入生产环境之前拦截它们。然而，这两类测试与传统单元测试有根本性差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统单元测试</th>\n<th>属性测试</th>\n<th>模糊测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行时间</td>\n<td>确定、短</td>\n<td>可配置、中等</td>\n<td>无界、长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果确定性</td>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>统计性</td>\n<td>非确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败重现</td>\n<td>总是可重现</td>\n<td>需要种子/数据库</td>\n<td>需要语料库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源消耗</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（CPU 密集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新代码检测</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>概率性</td>\n<td>需要时间积累</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些差异要求专门的 CI 集成策略——不能简单地把属性测试和模糊测试塞进常规的 <code>test</code> 步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性测试的-ci-配置\">属性测试的 CI 配置</h2><p>属性测试在 CI 中运行的核心挑战是<strong>执行时间</strong>与<strong>覆盖率</strong>的平衡。推荐的双层策略：</p>\n<p><strong>快速层（PR 检查，≤5 分钟）</strong>：减少 <code>max_examples</code>，确保基本覆盖</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# conftest.py - CI 环境自动调整&#10;import os&#10;from hypothesis import settings, Phase&#10;&#10;if os.environ.get(&#39;CI&#39;):&#10;    settings.register_profile(&#10;        &quot;ci-fast&quot;,&#10;        max_examples=200,          # 本地默认 1000&#10;        deadline=5000,             # 5 秒超时&#10;        suppress_health_check=[],&#10;    )&#10;    settings.load_profile(&quot;ci-fast&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># conftest.py - CI 环境自动调整</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settings, Phase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.environ.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CI'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.register_profile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"ci-fast\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 本地默认 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        deadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5 秒超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        suppress_health_check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.load_profile(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ci-fast\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>深度层（定时任务，每日/每周）</strong>：使用更高的 <code>max_examples</code>，开启更多探索</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"settings.register_profile(&#10;    &quot;ci-thorough&quot;,&#10;    max_examples=10000,&#10;    stateful_step_count=200,&#10;    deadline=None,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">settings.register_profile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"ci-thorough\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    stateful_step_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Hypothesis 数据库持久化</strong>：</p>\n<p>Hypothesis 将历史上触发失败的输入保存在 <code>.hypothesis/</code> 目录。在 CI 中持久化此目录可以跨运行保留知识——防止历史 bug 回归：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions&#10;- name: Cache hypothesis database&#10;  uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: .hypothesis/&#10;    key: hypothesis-${{ hashFiles(&#39;tests/**&#39;) }}&#10;    restore-keys: hypothesis-\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Cache hypothesis database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.hypothesis/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hypothesis-${{ hashFiles('tests/**') }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hypothesis-</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模糊测试的-ci-策略\">模糊测试的 CI 策略</h2><p>模糊测试在 CI 中有两种运行模式：</p>\n<p><strong>短期模糊（Smoke Fuzzing）</strong>：在每次 PR 中运行 5-15 分钟，作为回归防线</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"fuzz-smoke:&#10;  runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;  timeout-minutes: 15&#10;  steps:&#10;    - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;    - name: Build fuzz targets&#10;      run: go build -tags fuzzing ./...&#10;    - name: Run fuzz tests (5 min each)&#10;      run: |&#10;        for target in $(go test -list &#39;Fuzz.*&#39; ./... 2&gt;/dev/null | grep ^Fuzz); do&#10;          go test -fuzz=$target -fuzztime=5m ./... || true&#10;        done&#10;    - name: Upload crash artifacts&#10;      if: failure()&#10;      uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;      with:&#10;        name: fuzz-crashes&#10;        path: testdata/fuzz/**/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fuzz-smoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timeout-minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build fuzz targets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">go build -tags fuzzing ./...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run fuzz tests (5 min each)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        for target in $(go test -list 'Fuzz.*' ./... 2>/dev/null | grep ^Fuzz); do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          go test -fuzz=$target -fuzztime=5m ./... || true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Upload crash artifacts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fuzz-crashes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">testdata/fuzz/**/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>持续模糊（Continuous Fuzzing）</strong>：专用基础设施持续运行，积累覆盖率</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[代码推送] --&gt; B[短期模糊 5min/target]&#10;    B --&gt; C{发现崩溃?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[创建 Issue + 回归用例]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[合并代码]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; F[持续模糊集群]&#10;    F --&gt; G[24/7 运行]&#10;    G --&gt; H{发现新崩溃?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[创建高优先级 Issue]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[更新语料库覆盖率报告]&#10;&#10;    I --&gt; K[开发者修复]&#10;    K --&gt; L[崩溃输入加入回归测试]\">flowchart TD\n    A[代码推送] --&gt; B[短期模糊 5min/target]\n    B --&gt; C{发现崩溃?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[创建 Issue + 回归用例]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[合并代码]\n\n    E --&gt; F[持续模糊集群]\n    F --&gt; G[24/7 运行]\n    G --&gt; H{发现新崩溃?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[创建高优先级 Issue]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[更新语料库覆盖率报告]\n\n    I --&gt; K[开发者修复]\n    K --&gt; L[崩溃输入加入回归测试]</pre><h2 id=\"oss-fuzz-集成\">OSS-Fuzz 集成</h2><p>Google 的 OSS-Fuzz 为开源项目提供免费的持续模糊基础设施。Go 项目的 native fuzzing 原生支持 OSS-Fuzz：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# project.yaml (OSS-Fuzz 配置)&#10;homepage: &#39;https://github.com/your-org/your-project&#39;&#10;language: go&#10;fuzzing_engines:&#10;  - libfuzzer&#10;  - afl&#10;  - honggfuzz&#10;sanitizers:&#10;  - address&#10;  - undefined\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># project.yaml (OSS-Fuzz 配置)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">homepage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://github.com/your-org/your-project'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">go</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fuzzing_engines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">libfuzzer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">afl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">honggfuzz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sanitizers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">address</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">undefined</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OSS-Fuzz 提供的能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续运行</td>\n<td>在 Google 基础设施上 24/7 模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃去重</td>\n<td>自动去重和分类崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归检测</td>\n<td>新代码推送后自动回归已有语料库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率报告</td>\n<td>模糊覆盖率可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复验证</td>\n<td>修复后自动验证崩溃不再复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全公告</td>\n<td>安全漏洞延迟披露（90 天宽限期）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语料库管理策略\">语料库管理策略</h2><p>模糊测试的语料库是持续积累的资产——它记录了&quot;如何深入程序&quot;的路径知识。CI 中的语料库管理：</p>\n<p><strong>存储位置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"project/&#10;├── testdata/&#10;│   └── fuzz/&#10;│       ├── FuzzParseJSON/       # Go 标准位置&#10;│       │   ├── seed/            # 手工种子&#10;│       │   └── corpus/          # 自动发现的输入&#10;│       └── FuzzValidateInput/&#10;│           ├── seed/&#10;│           └── corpus/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── testdata/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── fuzz/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── FuzzParseJSON/       # Go 标准位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   ├── seed/            # 手工种子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   └── corpus/          # 自动发现的输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── FuzzValidateInput/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── seed/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           └── corpus/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>语料库同步策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交到 git</td>\n<td>简单、可追溯</td>\n<td>仓库膨胀</td>\n<td>种子和崩溃输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI artifact</td>\n<td>不污染仓库</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n<td>自动生成的语料库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云存储（GCS/S3）</td>\n<td>大容量、跨 CI</td>\n<td>需要配置</td>\n<td>大规模持续模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定期最小化+提交</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n<td>需要流程</td>\n<td>推荐的混合方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐做法：将<strong>种子语料库</strong>和<strong>回归输入</strong>（崩溃后精简的最小重现）提交到 git；将自动生成的大量中间语料库存储为 CI artifact 或云存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试的-ci-门禁\">变异测试的 CI 门禁</h2><p>变异测试在 CI 中通常以门禁（quality gate）的形式存在：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"mutation-gate:&#10;  runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;  steps:&#10;    - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;    - run: pnpm install&#10;    - run: pnpm stryker run --incremental&#10;    - name: Enforce mutation threshold&#10;      run: |&#10;        node -e &quot;&#10;          const report = require(&#39;./reports/mutation/mutation-report.json&#39;);&#10;          const score = report.files&#10;            .reduce((acc, f) =&gt; acc + f.mutationScore, 0) / report.files.length;&#10;          if (score &lt; 70) {&#10;            console.error(&#39;Mutation score &#39; + score + &#39;% below 70% threshold&#39;);&#10;            process.exit(1);&#10;          }&#10;        &quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">mutation-gate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm stryker run --incremental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce mutation threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        node -e \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          const report = require('./reports/mutation/mutation-report.json');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          const score = report.files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            .reduce((acc, f) => acc + f.mutationScore, 0) / report.files.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          if (score &#x3C; 70) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            console.error('Mutation score ' + score + '% below 70% threshold');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            process.exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>增量门禁</strong>（推荐）：不要求全局分数，只要求<em>新增/修改代码</em>的变异分数达标。这避免了&quot;历史债务阻塞新代码提交&quot;的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败管理与噪声控制\">失败管理与噪声控制</h2><p>属性测试和模糊测试的非确定性会产生&quot;闪烁测试&quot;（flaky test）问题。管理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>确定性种子</strong>：在 CI 中固定随机种子，使失败可重现</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# pytest 参数&#10;pytest --hypothesis-seed=12345&#10;&#10;# 或在代码中&#10;@settings(database=None, derandomize=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pytest 参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pytest </span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hypothesis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12345</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或在代码中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">database</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">derandomize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>失败去重</strong>：模糊测试可能对同一 bug 产生多个崩溃输入，需要按栈帧去重</p>\n<p><strong>超时管理</strong>：属性测试中的某些生成值可能导致被测函数超时，使用 <code>deadline</code> 设置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@settings(deadline=timedelta(seconds=5))&#10;@given(...)&#10;def test_property(...):&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">seconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(...):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>健康检查抑制</strong>：CI 环境中某些 Hypothesis 健康检查可能误报（如&quot;生成太慢&quot;），按需抑制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from hypothesis import HealthCheck&#10;&#10;@settings(suppress_health_check=[&#10;    HealthCheck.too_slow,&#10;    HealthCheck.filter_too_much,&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HealthCheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">suppress_health_check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    HealthCheck.too_slow,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    HealthCheck.filter_too_much,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"监控与度量\">监控与度量</h2><p>持续运行的测试需要可观测性——了解测试在做什么，效果如何：</p>\n<p><strong>关键指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>属性测试：max_examples 实际完成数、收缩次数、数据库命中率</li>\n<li>模糊测试：executions/sec、覆盖率增长曲线、新路径发现率</li>\n<li>变异测试：变异分数趋势、存活变异体数量变化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>覆盖率趋势追踪</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Go fuzzing 覆盖率报告&#10;go test -fuzz=FuzzTarget -fuzztime=1h -coverprofile=fuzz.cov ./...&#10;go tool cover -html=fuzz.cov -o fuzz-coverage.html\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Go fuzzing 覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fuzz=FuzzTarget</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fuzztime=1h</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -coverprofile=fuzz.cov</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cover</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -html=fuzz.cov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fuzz-coverage.html</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>属性测试和模糊测试的持续运行是其价值最大化的关键。CI 集成的核心策略：双层执行（快速 PR 检查 + 定期深度扫描）；Hypothesis 数据库持久化防止回归；短期模糊作为每次提交的回归防线；持续模糊（OSS-Fuzz 或自建集群）24/7 积累覆盖率；语料库管理区分种子（提交 git）和中间语料（CI artifact）；变异测试增量门禁渐进提升全局质量。噪声控制通过确定性种子、deadline 设置和健康检查抑制实现。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: CI 集成解决了&quot;何时运行、如何运行&quot;的问题；具体到每种编程语言，属性测试和模糊测试的工具选择和最佳实践各有不同。见 <a href=\"language-ecosystem\">语言生态系统</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 集成与持续模糊","id":"ci-集成与持续模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 CI 集成","id":"为什么需要-ci-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"属性测试的 CI 配置","id":"属性测试的-ci-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"模糊测试的 CI 策略","id":"模糊测试的-ci-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"OSS-Fuzz 集成","id":"oss-fuzz-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"语料库管理策略","id":"语料库管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试的 CI 门禁","id":"变异测试的-ci-门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"失败管理与噪声控制","id":"失败管理与噪声控制"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与度量","id":"监控与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"状态机测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/stateful-testing"},"next":{"title":"语言生态系统纵览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/language-ecosystem"}}